      "writtenOn": "2017-03-09T22:39:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You might also need to set mScanEventCallback to null, otherwise this class will hold the pointer before next subscription happens. This delays object destruction and might cause unexpected error in complex situations.   \nAlso, I would prefer to remove \u0027mScanEventSubscription\u0027 and only use \u0027mScanEventCallback\u0027 to tell if there is subscription or not.",
