      "writtenOn": "2017-03-10T23:58:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So we must expect client to setEventCallback() everytime before subscription?\nThe API is designed to have a single interface callback object across screen on/off. Otherwise, everytime screen goes on and off we have to create new interface object. \nIt makes sense to destroy this object when we no longer have the service running.",
      "parentUuid": "16695c25_998cb247",
